nt must have the same email domain  as the email and domain used on the  application  check your startup's funding your  startup must have received pre-c to  series a equity funding and if series a  that funding must have occurred within  one year of applying to that program  provide documentation of equity  investments via publicly available  online sources  examples include reputable news articles  investment aggregator sites and  investment portfolio posts  we cannot accept confidential  information and or social media posts  from your own company  please remember to double check all  parts of the application and eligibility  requirements prior to submitting and  with that you're ready to go  if your startup is beyond series a and  looking to migrate across from another  cloud provider or on-prem system this  migration program is the program for you  our migration incentive program is  designed to support later stage startups  by offsetting costs of migrating cloud  services and infrastructure to google  cloud  startups will receive high-touch  technical support to both plan and  execute the migration and access to  instructor-led and online training to  help ensure your team has the required  technical capabilities  our google cloud engineers and ecosystem  partners are ready to support you and  your migration journey  other benefits such as google workspace  google maps and google cloud skills  boost benefits are also offered to these  startups and your account manager will  support you in benefiting from these  incentives and beyond  to learn more about the migration  incentive program  please reach out to your dedicated sales  team who could be your personal guide  throughout the entire process you can be  connected to your sales team at  cloud.google.com  forward slash contact  apply for the google for startups cloud  program today  for google cloud technical support such  as bugs or quota requests or google  cloud billing support such as invoices  and account administration sign up for a  support plan at cloud.google.com forward  slash support this support will allow  you to self-service file tickets from  within your google cloud console  also be sure to check out the startup  resource homepage link in the  description box below a couple of  resources have been added to the  description box below to help you  understand these programs in further  detail so be sure to check them out in  the next episode we'll cover cloud  firestore and datastore including sample  architecture and a demonstration of  building a web application powered by  firestore  that brings us to the end of this video  where we went over the google for  startups program and the migration  incentive program  stay tuned for all the exciting and  helpful content that we have for you and  don't forget to like and subscribe to  our youtube channel click on the bell  icon to be notified each time a new  video is posted we hope to see you soon  in our next video  [Music]
 

